WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
Every change of the session, as one diff

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:09.000
In the review, press c to comment on the line at point

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.200
Press n to move to the next hunk

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:16.100
C-u C-c C-c shows the prompt the comment becomes
